  "title": "Menudo Rojo (Red Menudo)",
  "description": "Learn how to make menudo with tripe, two kinds of chile peppers, and canned hominy. This vibrantly colored soup is mildly spicy and quite easy to prepare.",
  "authors": [
    "GUSTAVO6"
  ],
